N1  THE REPAIR'S STRUCTURAL COST (indicative, not gates)
==============================================================================================================
    any R-only concave repair: C_R(+inf) - C_R(-inf) = int C_RR dR < 0 -- the R^(3)+sigma^2 coefficient differs
    between over- and under-dense leaves.  The arctan form: C_R = -eta M^2 arctan(R/Lambda) -> -/+ (pi/2) eta M^2, i.e.
    a Newton coupling G/(1 -/+ pi eta) wherever |delta rho| >> rho_L (every bound structure; CMB-epoch perturbations,
    where |R|/Lambda = 2 |delta| rho_bar/rho_L ~ 1e4 for delta ~ 1e-5 at z ~ 1100).  Scale analogy (L350):
    pi eta <= |G_cos/G_N - 1| cap 1.5 x (0.63-2.9)e-3  =>  eta <~ 3.0e-04 to 1.4e-03
    baseline canonical: eta_min first exceeds the tighter/looser indicative caps at z = 5.0 / 6.0
    baseline alt: eta_min first exceeds the tighter/looser indicative caps at z = 5.0 / 6.0
